cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Flash2OpenPMD: Conversion from FLASH to openPMD"
abstract: >-
  Converts FLASH simulation output (HDF5 plot files) to the openPMD format,
  for use as initial density profiles in particle-in-cell codes such as
  PIConGPU. Supports Cartesian geometry and cylindrical (r, z) geometry,
  which is rotated about its axis of symmetry into a 3D Cartesian volume,
  with optional GPU acceleration. Provides both a command-line interface
  and a graphical user interface.
